WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:00.955
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:01.225 --> 02:03.705
You've been going here and there around here for a while.

3
02:03.785 --> 02:06.545
Work. I've got three orders for campus errand runs.

4
02:10.705 --> 02:11.625
Using this?

5
02:12.385 --> 02:14.305
A junior lent it to me.

6
02:17.105 --> 02:18.185
I'll get going.

7
02:28.265 --> 02:29.145
Get off.

8
02:35.425 --> 02:37.305
I should've taken more orders.

9
02:38.865 --> 02:39.905
Take your time.

10
02:39.985 --> 02:42.025
I can take you around a few laps every day.

11
02:45.265 --> 02:47.665
By the way, I just left the lab,

12
02:47.745 --> 02:49.345
and I saw Xie Yudi being called in.

13
02:54.585 --> 02:56.545
Why isn't the dean here today?

14
02:56.625 --> 02:59.305
Does the university really care so little about me getting beaten up?

15
02:59.385 --> 03:01.265
Regarding the fight,

16
03:01.345 --> 03:03.425
we've spoken to several witnesses.

17
03:03.505 --> 03:05.505
They all said you were the one who started it.

18
03:06.105 --> 03:08.465
So you can just ask a few students and then pass judgment?

19
03:08.545 --> 03:09.545
Xie Yudi.

20
03:10.305 --> 03:12.865
Besides Chen Yanzhou, have you ever bullied any other students?

21
03:14.625 --> 03:17.185
Ma'am, I've never bullied anyone.

22
03:17.265 --> 03:18.785
But people are saying

23
03:19.505 --> 03:22.225
you bullied classmates back in high school,

24
03:22.865 --> 03:24.505
and that behavior continued into--

25
03:24.585 --> 03:25.745
You mean Zhuang Ning, right?

26
03:30.025 --> 03:32.105
I don't understand why everyone thinks that.

27
03:32.785 --> 03:34.345
She and I are from the same hometown.

28
03:34.425 --> 03:35.865
We're very close.

29
03:35.945 --> 03:37.385
That's right.

30
03:37.905 --> 03:40.025
I only learned about

31
03:40.105 --> 03:43.145
the condition of Zheng Yu's mom because Zhuang Ning told me.

32
03:44.585 --> 03:46.385
I couldn't think of any other way to help,

33
03:47.305 --> 03:49.745
so I came up with the idea of a fundraiser.

34
03:50.465 --> 03:53.025
If I'd been bullying her all this time,

35
03:54.065 --> 03:56.065
would she still share these things with me?

36
04:04.385 --> 04:06.105
Are you saying

37
04:06.185 --> 04:10.465
you learned everything about Zheng Yu from Zhuang Ning?

38
04:12.185 --> 04:14.425
Well, not entirely.

39
04:14.505 --> 04:16.225
I'd known for a long time

40
04:16.305 --> 04:18.865
that Zheng Yu was having a hard time.

41
04:19.465 --> 04:23.145
I'd lent her money and recommended a hospital to her.

42
04:23.225 --> 04:26.505
Later, I found out she was Zhuang Ning's roommate,

43
04:26.585 --> 04:28.265
which made me feel even closer to her.

44
04:28.345 --> 04:31.065
You can ask Zheng Yu about that yourself.

45
04:31.145 --> 04:34.985
If you're worried about hurting her pride,

46
04:35.065 --> 04:36.425
I have the transfer records here.

47
04:36.505 --> 04:39.505
As for Zhuang Ning, that's even simpler.

48
04:40.185 --> 04:42.705
Just call her in and ask her yourselves.

49
04:44.905 --> 04:46.425
Your word alone isn't enough.

50
04:47.065 --> 04:50.225
Zhuang Ning has been waiting next door for a while.

51
05:14.065 --> 05:14.945
Sit down.

52
05:15.825 --> 05:16.705
Have a seat.

53
05:17.465 --> 05:18.505
Come on.

54
05:26.385 --> 05:28.465
That's great. Now you can get to the bottom of this.

55
05:28.545 --> 05:31.625
Can the university issue an official statement or something afterward?

56
05:31.705 --> 05:33.905
When Chen Yanzhou was accused of cheating,

57
05:33.985 --> 05:35.305
the university cleared his name.

58
05:35.385 --> 05:37.345
The accusations against me

59
05:37.425 --> 05:38.425
are far more serious.

60
05:40.105 --> 05:44.305
Zhuang Ning. Mr. Song has probably told you everything Xie Yudi said.

61
05:45.105 --> 05:46.185
Is what he said true?

62
05:52.185 --> 05:53.145
It's true.

63
05:55.465 --> 05:57.865
I've told him a lot about Zheng Yu.

64
05:58.585 --> 06:00.225
Zhuang Ning is a pretty introverted person,

65
06:00.865 --> 06:02.705
and she doesn't have many friends here.

66
06:03.785 --> 06:06.785
So she could only talk to an old classmate like me about dorm matters.

67
06:08.985 --> 06:12.505
I told him when Zheng Yu would be in the dorm,

68
06:12.585 --> 06:16.025
when she'd go to her part-time job, which classes she'd chosen,

69
06:16.105 --> 06:18.785
and how many words she'd exchanged with male classmates.

70
06:18.865 --> 06:20.465
-Zhuang Ning. -What color she was wearing…

71
06:22.385 --> 06:23.825
What are you talking about?

72
06:28.545 --> 06:29.545
What's wrong?

73
06:30.345 --> 06:31.705
Aren't we old classmates?

74
06:32.305 --> 06:34.985
We talk all the time and share things with each other.

75
06:38.065 --> 06:38.985
And that's not all.

76
06:39.785 --> 06:41.465
We used to hang out together all the time too.

77
06:52.305 --> 06:55.065
I, ZHUANG NING, FORMALLY REPORT MY CLASSMATE, XIE YUDI.

78
07:24.865 --> 07:25.985
What are you doing?

79
07:26.585 --> 07:28.025
Xie Yudi, what's with that attitude?

80
07:29.945 --> 07:31.545
You have some nerve.

81
07:33.905 --> 07:35.065
As you said,

82
07:35.665 --> 07:37.345
we're adults now, after all.

83
07:37.425 --> 07:38.665
We're adults now, after all.

84
07:52.225 --> 07:53.065
Xie Yudi!

85
07:54.505 --> 07:55.785
Xie Yudi, stop right there!

86
08:03.465 --> 08:04.385
Zhuang Ning.

87
08:05.105 --> 08:06.265
You can go back for now.

88
08:07.465 --> 08:10.105
The college will make sure this is properly addressed.

89
08:12.345 --> 08:13.345
Ma'am.

90
08:13.865 --> 08:16.105
I have one more thing to give you.

91
08:19.425 --> 08:22.145
I wonder how this whole thing will eventually be handled.

92
08:27.105 --> 08:30.025
Can I ask you what happened between you and Xie Yudi?

93
08:34.945 --> 08:37.904
He was the first person I met here.

94
08:41.745 --> 08:44.905
We added each other on WeChat at the start of our freshman year.

95
08:44.985 --> 08:45.865
XIE YUDI

96
08:48.545 --> 08:49.385
Zheng Yu.

97
08:50.225 --> 08:51.585
Why are your eyes so red?

98
08:52.905 --> 08:55.825
I got dust in my eyes in the stairwell.

99
08:58.345 --> 09:00.465
By the way, how's Mom doing?

100
09:00.545 --> 09:03.665
The doctor said her condition is stable for now, so don't worry.

101
09:08.505 --> 09:10.465
There are plenty of hospitals in Qingyi,

102
09:10.545 --> 09:13.385
but none can take a patient who's been unconscious for this long

103
09:13.465 --> 09:14.865
on a long-term basis.

104
09:15.945 --> 09:16.825
Let me keep looking.

105
09:17.465 --> 09:19.385
Transferring hospitals will cost a lot, right?

106
09:22.065 --> 09:23.625
Just focus on preparing for your exams.

107
09:24.425 --> 09:27.465
Don't end up not getting into a school here.

108
09:28.785 --> 09:30.065
As for Mom…

109
09:32.545 --> 09:34.305
I won't leave her there

110
09:35.065 --> 09:36.505
all alone.

111
09:39.345 --> 09:40.185
All right.

112
09:40.265 --> 09:41.505
Goodbye for now.

113
10:32.345 --> 10:35.105
Are you the freshman representative from the College of Life Sciences

114
10:35.185 --> 10:36.945
who gave a speech at orientation?

115
10:38.705 --> 10:40.185
I'm in Life Sciences Class 1 too.

116
10:40.265 --> 10:42.705
I'm here to take some footage for our PR department.

117
10:43.825 --> 10:44.985
Hi there.

118
10:53.225 --> 10:55.265
There's a hospital near our university called Ji Heng.

119
10:55.345 --> 10:57.585
It has its own rehab center

120
10:57.665 --> 11:00.025
and can accommodate patients in a vegetative state long-term.

121
11:00.905 --> 11:02.065
Ji Heng is a private hospital.

122
11:02.145 --> 11:04.665
Right, it is pretty expensive.

123
11:04.745 --> 11:07.745
But still, you should look into it.

124
11:07.825 --> 11:10.825
It was recently added to the list of approved medical providers,

125
11:10.905 --> 11:13.185
so some costs can be covered by insurance.

126
11:14.825 --> 11:17.785
Also, they run a program called Compassionate Care Bed.

127
11:18.585 --> 11:20.065
You can try applying.

128
11:20.145 --> 11:23.185
If you manage to secure a spot, you'll get a partial fee discount.

129
11:24.865 --> 11:26.185
Compassionate Care Bed?

130
11:26.985 --> 11:28.025
I've never heard of it.

131
11:28.105 --> 11:30.865
There are very few spots, so it's not widely advertised.

132
11:30.945 --> 11:33.025
It's all about having access to the right information.

133
11:35.025 --> 11:37.785
If you still can't find another solution for now,

134
11:38.705 --> 11:40.305
I can lend you some money.

135
11:40.945 --> 11:43.745
Then at least you could move your mom here first.

136
11:47.425 --> 11:48.945
It's fine.

137
11:49.025 --> 11:51.025
We'll be classmates for four years.

138
11:51.105 --> 11:52.545
It's not like you're going to run away.

139
11:57.105 --> 11:59.425
Come to me if you need anything. I won't run away either.

140
12:00.505 --> 12:01.745
Bye.

141
12:25.745 --> 12:27.905
All I wanted at the time was to bring my mom over.

142
12:28.625 --> 12:29.665
I didn't have time to think.

143
12:29.745 --> 12:30.625
NEW FRIEND XIE YUDI

144
12:30.705 --> 12:32.425
I had my doubts,

145
12:32.505 --> 12:35.865
but something else happened soon after that made me let my guard down.

146
12:37.265 --> 12:38.545
Are you crazy?

147
12:38.625 --> 12:39.465
JIANG HAIXIN

148
12:39.545 --> 12:41.585
You took your mom away without even telling me!

149
12:42.385 --> 12:45.265
Wu and the others didn't see your mom at the hospital and thought you'd run,

150
12:45.345 --> 12:47.505
so they've been harassing me with calls every day!

151
12:47.585 --> 12:49.585
How am I supposed to run my business like this?

152
12:50.465 --> 12:52.425
And don't contact Xiaomian anymore, okay?

153
12:52.505 --> 12:54.585
You're distracting him from his studies.

154
12:59.985 --> 13:00.905
Zheng Yu.

155
13:05.865 --> 13:07.265
I have good news.

156
13:07.865 --> 13:09.265
Starting next month,

157
13:09.345 --> 13:12.905
your mom will be eligible for the Compassionate Care Bed program.

158
13:13.985 --> 13:15.385
Really?

159
13:15.465 --> 13:18.465
After you told me about it, I went to ask around.

160
13:18.545 --> 13:22.265
They said there are very few spots, and lots of people apply for them.

161
13:23.225 --> 13:24.705
Trust me, I wouldn't lie to you.

162
13:25.345 --> 13:27.945
But once your mom gets a spot,

163
13:28.025 --> 13:32.025
make sure you don't talk to anyone else at the hospital about it.

164
13:38.745 --> 13:40.905
The reason I know Ji Heng so well

165
13:41.825 --> 13:42.825
is that my uncle

166
13:43.785 --> 13:46.225
is the director of the hospital's rehab center.

167
13:46.825 --> 13:48.665
Please keep this between us.

168
13:48.745 --> 13:50.025
I don't want to get him in trouble.

169
13:53.625 --> 13:54.665
Are you

170
13:55.985 --> 13:57.265
uncomfortable with doing this?

171
13:59.705 --> 14:03.265
Trying to take the moral high ground now would just make me look more ridiculous.

172
14:09.345 --> 14:10.185
Hello?

173
14:10.265 --> 14:11.305
Dr. Zhao?

174
14:12.585 --> 14:13.465
All right.

175
14:14.105 --> 14:14.945
I understand.

176
14:18.025 --> 14:18.945
I really got it.

177
14:23.705 --> 14:27.505
Maybe it was because I accepted that unfairly allocated spot

178
14:28.385 --> 14:30.465
that I later suffered all those consequences.

179
14:35.305 --> 14:36.145
XIE YUDI

180
14:36.225 --> 14:38.225
You've got a grain of rice on your chin.

181
15:01.625 --> 15:02.625
My tumbler.

182
15:15.865 --> 15:18.505
Your tumbler doesn't keep drinks warm at all.

183
15:19.025 --> 15:19.945
I'll buy you a new one.

184
15:25.585 --> 15:26.585
Why did you block me?

185
15:28.025 --> 15:29.585
I've paid back all the money I owed you.

186
15:30.745 --> 15:32.825
I won't need to transfer money to you on WeChat anymore.

187
15:41.065 --> 15:42.145
What happened to your hand?

188
15:44.945 --> 15:45.825
It's nothing.

189
15:46.465 --> 15:49.385
I sent friend requests from an alt account so many times, but you never accepted.

190
15:49.465 --> 15:51.065
Time feels so slow,

191
15:51.145 --> 15:52.705
so every hour,

192
15:53.945 --> 15:55.665
I just feel like cutting here.

193
16:00.905 --> 16:01.985
What happened after that?

194
16:03.545 --> 16:06.145
I later realized that was only the beginning.

195
16:06.225 --> 16:09.505
He threatened to jump off a building, throw himself in front of a train,

196
16:09.585 --> 16:10.945
and cut off his fingers.

197
16:14.945 --> 16:17.785
All of it was just his way of trying to make me obey him.

198
16:17.865 --> 16:19.825
But to avoid more trouble…

199
16:19.905 --> 16:21.065
No.

200
16:22.065 --> 16:23.545
The truth is,

201
16:23.625 --> 16:26.985
I didn't want to lose the hospital spot, so I put up with it.

202
16:30.105 --> 16:33.185
It seems I should've hit him a few more times.

203
16:36.665 --> 16:38.865
You've done everything you could.

204
16:38.945 --> 16:41.465
And I've done everything I could too.

205
16:47.265 --> 16:48.665
I have something to do. I'll get going.

206
16:57.825 --> 16:59.985
Goodness! Good thing I ran fast.

207
17:00.065 --> 17:02.105
It started raining just as I reached the dorm.

208
17:05.305 --> 17:06.464
Oh, right.

209
17:06.545 --> 17:10.184
The pharmacist said you can't take more than two pills a day,

210
17:10.265 --> 17:11.385
so don't take too many.

211
17:16.065 --> 17:18.424
Do you think things worked out for Zhuang Ning?

212
17:20.224 --> 17:22.785
You're in so much pain, and you're still thinking about that?

213
17:22.865 --> 17:24.545
I did my part, after all.

214
17:26.625 --> 17:27.825
It should work out.

215
17:28.424 --> 17:29.465
I hope so.

216
17:29.985 --> 17:30.825
It definitely will!

217
17:32.665 --> 17:34.585
By the way, what did you say just now?

218
17:35.185 --> 17:36.065
"It definitely will."

219
17:36.665 --> 17:38.625
No, what did you say when you came in?

220
17:39.545 --> 17:40.425
It's raining.

221
17:58.025 --> 17:59.025
Zhuang Ning.

222
18:07.545 --> 18:08.865
I'm going the same way.

223
18:09.985 --> 18:10.825
Thank you.

224
18:11.425 --> 18:12.625
Let's go.

225
18:14.065 --> 18:15.185
Zhuang Ning.

226
18:18.865 --> 18:21.785
A certain young lady said you'd catch a cold if you got soaked,

227
18:21.865 --> 18:23.385
so she insisted I come get you.

228
18:27.105 --> 18:28.745
So are you hungry?

229
18:34.225 --> 18:35.065
Fangli.

230
18:35.145 --> 18:35.985
TWELVE HOURS AGO

231
18:36.065 --> 18:38.905
I just got their Hometown Association Registration Forms from Zhang Qi.

232
18:38.985 --> 18:40.065
It turns out Zhuang Ning…

233
18:40.985 --> 18:42.625
She was Xie Yudi's high school classmate.

234
18:54.065 --> 18:55.505
REPORT LETTER

235
18:55.585 --> 18:57.385
SUPPRESSING A HEAVY AND FEARFUL HEART,

236
18:57.465 --> 19:00.345
BUT COMPELLED BY THE NEED TO SEEK JUSTICE…

237
19:08.985 --> 19:11.025
This one's not good. Use mine.

238
19:11.105 --> 19:14.425
Here's my brightest red lipstick to press for your fingerprint when you're done.

239
19:17.745 --> 19:19.385
Zheng Yu, when did you get back?

240
19:19.465 --> 19:20.585
Just now.

241
19:20.665 --> 19:24.105
Chen Yanzhou and I got the contact details of the owner of the base where we stayed.

242
19:24.185 --> 19:25.985
They have security footage of the activity room.

243
19:26.065 --> 19:28.745
Also, I sent you a copy of a chat history.

244
19:28.825 --> 19:30.785
It should come in handy.

245
19:31.945 --> 19:33.625
Zheng Yu, you're amazing!

246
19:33.705 --> 19:35.265
Seriously, you're incredible!

247
19:37.265 --> 19:38.305
Let's see.

248
20:04.065 --> 20:05.545
We still have to wait for the outcome,

249
20:06.225 --> 20:07.305
but even so,

250
20:07.385 --> 20:10.305
I feel so much lighter now.

251
20:12.345 --> 20:13.185
That's good.

252
20:13.265 --> 20:15.625
Let's go back to the dorm and take a shower.

253
20:16.505 --> 20:18.465
Whoever gets back first showers first.

254
20:18.545 --> 20:20.785
-Three, two… -Liu Linlin, that's cheating!

255
20:26.065 --> 20:27.185
Zheng Yu, let's run!

256
20:33.465 --> 20:34.985
Is everyone free this weekend?

257
20:35.065 --> 20:36.905
Let's go out for a nice meal together.

258
20:36.985 --> 20:38.905
I'm in! I've been craving a fancy meal!

259
20:38.985 --> 20:39.905
I have no problem.

260
20:41.145 --> 20:42.225
What about Zheng Yu?

261
20:42.305 --> 20:45.025
I'll be free after my part-time job, but it'll be a bit late.

262
21:01.985 --> 21:02.865
HAVE YOU HEARD?

263
21:02.945 --> 21:05.785
XYD FROM LIFE SCIENCES WAS CAUGHT BULLYING A GIRL IN HIS CLASS.

264
21:31.145 --> 21:34.945
DAD

265
21:40.825 --> 21:41.905
Sign the papers.

266
21:41.985 --> 21:44.305
You just need to complete all the withdrawal procedures.

267
21:45.425 --> 21:47.185
The police have opened a case.

268
21:47.265 --> 21:48.505
They'll contact you as needed.

269
21:48.585 --> 21:51.905
Keep your phone on after you leave, and report to the police when summoned.

270
21:52.665 --> 21:55.625
The university will fully cooperate with the investigation. You should too.

271
21:55.705 --> 21:56.705
That's all.

272
21:58.505 --> 21:59.785
Thank you, ma'am.

273
21:59.865 --> 22:02.105
Thank you for handling this. I know it's been a lot of work.

274
22:02.185 --> 22:03.225
It's no trouble.

275
22:03.305 --> 22:05.185
Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.

276
22:17.025 --> 22:19.225
Don't ask me why I didn't save you.

277
22:20.025 --> 22:22.785
I don't think you should keep studying here.

278
22:22.865 --> 22:23.945
Yes.

279
22:24.025 --> 22:24.905
Once again,

280
22:25.505 --> 22:26.785
you've disappointed me.

281
23:10.905 --> 23:12.105
DELETE CONTACT?

282
23:15.025 --> 23:16.185
XIE YUDI

283
23:16.265 --> 23:18.785
BLOCK?

284
23:18.865 --> 23:20.785
ADD TO BLACKLIST CONFIRM?

285
23:20.865 --> 23:21.745
SAVING

286
24:10.785 --> 24:11.665
Class dismissed.

287
24:15.785 --> 24:17.385
What job did you take this time?

288
24:17.905 --> 24:18.785
Is it difficult?

289
24:22.665 --> 24:23.865
It's not work.

290
24:25.105 --> 24:26.745
You're going out to eat with someone?

291
24:29.465 --> 24:31.425
-Who? -My roommates.

292
24:35.785 --> 24:37.625
Do you know any good restaurants?

293
24:38.505 --> 24:41.105
Forget it. You don't live on campus or have many friends.

294
24:41.185 --> 24:43.425
You probably don't know the good food spots near campus.

295
24:45.425 --> 24:46.265
Fine.

296
24:46.345 --> 24:47.225
Take your time looking.

297
24:47.305 --> 24:50.065
Since I have no friends and don't live on campus, I'll leave now.

298
24:51.025 --> 24:52.105
Are you mad?

299
24:53.505 --> 24:54.345
No.

300
24:55.185 --> 24:56.505
You have people to eat with,

301
24:56.585 --> 24:57.705
and so do I.

302
24:57.785 --> 24:58.865
Bye.

303
25:03.265 --> 25:04.345
Who?

304
25:06.505 --> 25:08.425
Their signature dishes are pineapple fried rice,

305
25:08.505 --> 25:10.425
massaman curry, and coconut chicken soup.

306
25:10.505 --> 25:12.865
They also have drunken noodles, but those contain chili.

307
25:12.945 --> 25:15.665
If you think choosing is too much trouble, you can order a meal set.

308
25:15.745 --> 25:17.545
They have a set for four.

309
25:17.625 --> 25:19.705
You know the menu so well. Have you eaten here?

310
25:19.785 --> 25:21.625
No. I looked it up before coming.

311
25:22.905 --> 25:24.865
Then let's get the set for four.

312
25:26.185 --> 25:29.625
One meal set for four. And a dozen beers.

313
25:30.225 --> 25:31.425
Isn't a dozen a bit much?

314
25:32.025 --> 25:33.145
I'll drink them if you won't.

315
25:35.545 --> 25:36.465
Drink up.

316
25:42.225 --> 25:43.785
Thanks for your help last time.

317
25:43.865 --> 25:46.065
I didn't keep it from your mom just to help you out.

318
25:46.145 --> 25:47.985
I didn't want her to worry about you.

319
25:49.785 --> 25:50.665
Still, thank you.

320
25:52.905 --> 25:54.105
Did you read the email I sent you?

321
25:54.745 --> 25:57.385
The one about the internship at the German research institute?

322
25:57.465 --> 25:58.825
Let's break it down.

323
26:00.425 --> 26:03.665
The paper you've been wanting to work on the most has already been submitted.

324
26:03.745 --> 26:07.345
By senior year, you'll barely have any classes left, and our college's policy

325
26:07.425 --> 26:09.105
gives you credits for internships.

326
26:09.745 --> 26:12.545
Given our university's ranking and your GPA,

327
26:12.625 --> 26:15.545
applying to this institute in the second half of the year will be perfect timing.

328
26:17.545 --> 26:19.305
It's a cancer research project.

329
26:20.025 --> 26:21.185
So you did read it.

330
26:22.225 --> 26:23.785
What's wrong with cancer research?

331
26:24.705 --> 26:26.385
I'd still rather study plants.

332
26:39.705 --> 26:40.905
Your brother's gone.

333
26:42.545 --> 26:44.705
Your mom has lost her memory.

334
26:44.785 --> 26:46.625
Your dad just does whatever you say.

335
26:47.585 --> 26:49.345
Looks like I'm the only one who still remembers

336
26:49.425 --> 26:51.185
that your dream used to be becoming a doctor.

337
26:58.665 --> 27:01.105
Go back and prepare your resume. Give the application a shot.

338
27:01.185 --> 27:04.385
That institute has very high standards. There's no guarantee you'll get in.

339
27:07.105 --> 27:08.265
It's going to rain.

340
27:09.025 --> 27:11.865
You should head back soon. I only have one umbrella.

341
27:22.425 --> 27:24.665
Hey, take it easy on the drinks.

342
27:24.745 --> 27:27.545
Eat something to line your stomach. Don't just drink all night.

343
27:30.705 --> 27:31.785
No, no.

344
27:32.825 --> 27:34.385
There's still food there.

345
27:34.465 --> 27:36.145
-I want hers. -You…

346
27:36.225 --> 27:37.505
I'll order you a fresh bowl.

347
27:37.585 --> 27:38.905
I still remember

348
27:39.465 --> 27:42.025
how, back when we first moved into Room 223,

349
27:42.105 --> 27:44.065
I asked to buy some of your food, but you wouldn't sell.

350
27:44.745 --> 27:46.665
And you still won't share with me.

351
27:48.945 --> 27:50.065
Have you had too much to drink?

352
27:50.145 --> 27:51.745
How can you hold a grudge for so long?

353
28:10.585 --> 28:11.545
There. Happy now?

354
28:12.825 --> 28:13.665
Yes.

355
28:18.145 --> 28:20.265
So how is it? Does leftover food taste good?

356
28:22.785 --> 28:26.025
-I'm not eating it. I don't want any! -Try some. Just a bite!

357
28:26.105 --> 28:27.185
You eat it.

358
28:27.265 --> 28:29.625
Come on, eat it. You eat it.

359
28:29.705 --> 28:30.745
Zhuang Ning.

360
28:30.825 --> 28:32.865
-Try it! It's really good! -No, no.

361
28:32.945 --> 28:34.305
-You eat more. -You eat more.

362
28:34.385 --> 28:35.785
-You eat. -I'm not eating it.

363
28:35.865 --> 28:36.745
You eat all of it.

364
28:36.825 --> 28:40.905
Yours is all burnt! Just try another bite!

365
28:40.985 --> 28:44.025
-One more bite! -Just eat it. I'm not eating it.

366
28:44.105 --> 28:45.545
You all know

367
28:46.145 --> 28:48.065
that I work part-time at a convenience store.

368
28:48.145 --> 28:51.025
The shelf life of their boxed meals is 36 hours.

369
28:52.385 --> 28:55.025
The first 12 hours are for production and delivery to stores.

370
28:55.105 --> 28:58.385
The remaining 24 hours are the selling period.

371
29:00.465 --> 29:01.585
What are you trying to say?

372
29:03.345 --> 29:05.625
The night you moved in,

373
29:05.705 --> 29:07.145
my boxed meal had expired.

374
29:08.265 --> 29:10.905
I was embarrassed, so I didn't give it to you.

375
29:15.825 --> 29:17.585
Back then, the day of the Sports Meet,

376
29:18.545 --> 29:20.825
I didn't accept the shoes you gave me

377
29:22.145 --> 29:25.345
because I was afraid that when your birthdays came around,

378
29:25.425 --> 29:27.545
I wouldn't be able to get you gifts in return.

379
29:27.625 --> 29:29.665
I used to turn down meals with you

380
29:29.745 --> 29:31.865
because I couldn't afford to pay my share.

381
29:31.945 --> 29:33.385
I didn't want to freeload.

382
29:34.945 --> 29:38.265
Maintaining friendships costs too much money for me.

383
29:40.185 --> 29:41.785
Sometimes, I really envy you guys.

384
29:50.105 --> 29:51.545
I envy you too.

385
29:56.665 --> 29:57.705
Actually,

386
29:58.465 --> 30:00.225
I'm not bothered by light when I sleep.

387
30:01.265 --> 30:03.905
And when you study at night,

388
30:03.985 --> 30:05.865
your desk lamp isn't bright at all.

389
30:09.385 --> 30:11.545
It's seeing how hard you work that keeps me awake.

390
30:13.305 --> 30:14.505
Do you know

391
30:14.585 --> 30:16.305
how intimidating it is for someone like me,

392
30:16.385 --> 30:18.665
who spent years diligently studying

393
30:18.745 --> 30:20.745
and still barely managed to get into this university,

394
30:21.865 --> 30:24.905
to room with someone like you?

395
30:29.105 --> 30:30.425
Linlin.

396
30:30.505 --> 30:31.905
Have you had too much to drink too?

397
30:32.945 --> 30:34.185
And you!

398
30:35.145 --> 30:38.385
In life, you have to be good at either studying or having fun.

399
30:38.465 --> 30:39.785
You're really good at having fun.

400
30:39.865 --> 30:42.945
Why do I feel like that's not a compliment?

401
30:44.025 --> 30:47.185
But if you want to have fun, I'll take you along wherever I go from now on.

402
30:48.545 --> 30:51.025
Linlin. You're already amazing.

403
30:51.665 --> 30:54.545
You don't have to comfort me. I'm saying this because I've thought it through.

404
30:56.185 --> 30:57.985
Growing up, people always told us

405
30:58.065 --> 30:59.585
that everyone has a purpose in life.

406
31:00.185 --> 31:02.665
But as we got older, we realized we're just expendable.

407
31:04.305 --> 31:09.705
The truth is, most of us in this world are probably just disposable.

408
31:15.145 --> 31:16.345
Then let's toast

409
31:17.025 --> 31:18.145
to being expendable!

410
31:18.225 --> 31:19.625
Sure!

411
31:20.225 --> 31:21.905
-To being expendable! -To being expendable!

412
31:27.345 --> 31:28.425
To the future!

413
31:28.945 --> 31:30.305
-Cheers! -Cheers!

414
32:09.265 --> 32:11.545
Did Xu Fangli drink so much that she passed out in the restroom?

415
32:13.225 --> 32:14.625
Linlin's with her. Don't worry.

416
32:23.065 --> 32:23.905
Zheng Yu.

417
32:27.745 --> 32:29.065
This is for you.

418
32:34.105 --> 32:34.945
"Rain."

419
32:35.625 --> 32:37.865
"Zhuangzi's Butterfly Dream."

420
32:43.985 --> 32:46.945
VICTORY WON'T COME TO ME UNLESS I GO TO IT

421
32:53.385 --> 32:56.865
1,800 is already a bargain. I can't go any lower.

422
32:57.785 --> 32:58.985
All right.

423
32:59.065 --> 33:00.345
Are you sure you want it?

424
33:01.345 --> 33:04.265
Which dorm building do you live in? Which room?

425
33:04.345 --> 33:07.145
I can deliver it to you. We'll do the exchange in person.

426
33:07.225 --> 33:09.625
ZHUANGZI'S BUTTERFLY DREAM

427
33:09.705 --> 33:10.625
Sure.

428
33:11.185 --> 33:13.305
I live in Room 223 of Sixian Hall.

429
33:31.425 --> 33:33.425
I'm too far away from you.

430
33:33.505 --> 33:36.385
How about leaving it in the library locker?

431
33:37.185 --> 33:38.025
Okay.

432
33:42.465 --> 33:44.065
I just remembered something.

433
33:44.145 --> 33:47.385
I put stickers on my laptop. There's a string of English words on them.

434
33:47.465 --> 33:50.625
The adhesive is pretty strong, so I'll take another 200 off.

435
33:53.585 --> 33:55.265
Why didn't you tell me back then

436
33:55.345 --> 33:56.945
that you were the one who sold me the laptop?

437
33:58.425 --> 34:01.545
Because I was judging you by my own standards.

438
34:02.345 --> 34:04.585
I was worried you'd feel embarrassed buying secondhand.

439
34:05.225 --> 34:07.145
But after getting to know you,

440
34:07.945 --> 34:09.585
I realized I was overthinking it.

441
34:11.225 --> 34:12.065
Thank you.

442
34:14.264 --> 34:15.625
You're the one who helped me.

443
34:27.744 --> 34:29.344
Your brother's gone.

444
34:30.585 --> 34:32.505
Your mother has lost her memory.

445
34:33.625 --> 34:35.225
Your dad just does whatever you say.

446
34:36.145 --> 34:37.865
Looks like I'm the only one who still remembers

447
34:37.945 --> 34:39.985
that your dream used to be becoming a doctor.

448
35:31.465 --> 35:34.945
It's the rainy season. It starts raining before you know it.

449
35:35.025 --> 35:37.585
Even I forgot my umbrella. I wonder if those two brought theirs.

450
35:40.305 --> 35:42.665
Isn't that Chen Yanzhou?

451
35:46.985 --> 35:49.145
What a coincidence. You two are eating here?

452
35:49.225 --> 35:52.025
What are you doing here? Didn't you have plans with someone?

453
35:53.465 --> 35:55.305
I just finished eating and was heading home.

454
35:55.905 --> 35:56.825
Excuse me.

455
35:56.905 --> 36:00.145
Where have all the handsome guys in the world gone?

456
36:00.225 --> 36:02.425
They're all waiting for you in the dorm! Let's go.

457
36:05.265 --> 36:06.745
Chen Yanzhou.

458
36:09.465 --> 36:12.225
Why are you standing so close to Zheng Yu?

459
36:13.865 --> 36:16.385
Let me tell you, he's a bad guy. A really terrible one!

460
36:16.465 --> 36:19.185
I asked him for a bottle of water at the Sports Meet, and he said no.

461
36:19.265 --> 36:21.785
I'm a whole person, yet I'm worth less than a bottle of water!

462
36:22.465 --> 36:23.705
Fangli.

463
36:23.785 --> 36:24.945
Our ride is here.

464
36:25.625 --> 36:26.865
Here.

465
36:28.585 --> 36:29.625
I'll go first.

466
36:31.385 --> 36:32.705
Come on.

467
36:35.225 --> 36:36.545
Get in.

468
36:36.625 --> 36:37.465
Oh gosh.

469
36:38.825 --> 36:39.745
I'll get going.

470
36:40.345 --> 36:41.265
I…

471
36:41.985 --> 36:43.545
I'll walk you to the car.

472
36:48.985 --> 36:51.305
Fangli, move over. There's no room for Zheng Yu.

473
36:51.385 --> 36:55.585
Why is this Ferrari so small? I can't even stretch my legs!

474
36:55.665 --> 36:57.585
Oh gosh.

475
36:58.265 --> 37:00.745
I actually have something to do and need to stop by the lab.

476
37:02.025 --> 37:03.945
Let's just make do and walk back.

477
37:05.065 --> 37:07.465
Then I'll leave Zheng Yu in your hands.

478
37:17.305 --> 37:18.145
Let's go.

479
37:23.705 --> 37:25.465
Didn't you just say

480
37:26.385 --> 37:27.825
you were going home after your date?

481
37:27.905 --> 37:29.665
Why are you suddenly going to the lab?

482
37:30.865 --> 37:31.705
A date?

483
37:34.385 --> 37:36.545
You mean me and Li Yanan?

484
37:38.705 --> 37:41.505
So you were having dinner with Mr. Li.

485
37:44.385 --> 37:45.985
I was going home,

486
37:46.065 --> 37:48.865
but then I remembered I forgot to change the water in the trays.

487
37:48.945 --> 37:51.705
All those plants in the lab are waiting for me to take care of them.

488
37:51.785 --> 37:53.105
What about you?

489
37:53.185 --> 37:54.985
How did your date go?

490
37:56.025 --> 37:57.105
It was strange.

491
37:57.745 --> 38:01.625
There were things I didn't want to say for all sorts of reasons before.

492
38:01.705 --> 38:03.145
Today, I finally said them all.

493
38:03.825 --> 38:07.585
Is it really better to say the things you don't want to say?

494
38:08.265 --> 38:10.505
I'm not sure if things are really better,

495
38:11.665 --> 38:13.825
but it wasn't as hard as I thought.

496
38:13.905 --> 38:17.225
And after I said everything, everyone felt closer.

497
38:19.545 --> 38:20.465
What about you?

498
38:20.545 --> 38:23.265
Is there something you've been hiding and haven't said?

499
38:26.705 --> 38:27.625
Watch your step.

500
39:05.105 --> 39:06.265
Hold on a second.

501
39:12.185 --> 39:14.625
-You didn't get wet at all. -What are you doing?

502
39:16.385 --> 39:19.105
I left you behind earlier, so I felt a little bad.

503
39:19.185 --> 39:23.265
So I wanted to see if your knight in shining armor

504
39:23.345 --> 39:24.905
had done his job properly.

505
39:25.985 --> 39:27.025
How childish.

506
39:27.825 --> 39:28.865
So childish!

507
39:30.505 --> 39:32.145
I still want another drink.

508
39:32.225 --> 39:33.185
Stop drinking.

509
39:33.265 --> 39:34.225
Go to sleep.

510
39:39.185 --> 39:40.025
Zheng Yu.

511
39:40.105 --> 39:42.985
Do you want to hear the gossip about Fangli meeting a hot guy tonight?

512
39:45.305 --> 39:46.585
Zheng Yu.

513
39:48.785 --> 39:49.625
Zheng Yu.

514
39:52.585 --> 39:53.505
Zhuang Ning.

515
39:54.225 --> 39:56.065
-Let's make a bet. -About what?

516
39:56.145 --> 39:58.825
That Chen Yanzhou likes Zheng Yu.

517
39:59.625 --> 40:02.505
I started suspecting it when they worked together during the Excellence Cup.

518
40:03.345 --> 40:07.105
Honestly, that's not much of a bet.

519
40:08.385 --> 40:10.025
You noticed it too?

520
40:10.105 --> 40:11.625
Everyone's noticed it.

521
40:23.345 --> 40:25.385
ALLELES: DOMINANT AND RECESSIVE

522
41:36.225 --> 41:38.465
Looks like your practical skills aren't that great either.

523
41:38.545 --> 41:40.345
How did you let these bellflowers get so bad?

524
41:40.425 --> 41:42.705
ZHENG YU

525
41:46.025 --> 41:47.625
What brings you to the hospital?

526
41:54.505 --> 41:57.345
Ms. Yang messaged me asking me to come save this plant.

527
41:57.425 --> 41:59.665
Look, she even trusts me…

528
42:08.505 --> 42:09.785
Xiaochen.

529
42:09.865 --> 42:10.985
Ms. Yang.

530
42:11.065 --> 42:13.265
You're Chen Yanzhou?

531
42:17.505 --> 42:18.665
Xiaomian.

532
42:18.745 --> 42:19.945
What brings you here today?

533
42:21.025 --> 42:22.145
My exams are over,

534
42:22.225 --> 42:24.665
so I came to show my grades to my sister and Mom.

535
42:28.545 --> 42:30.425
Don't just stand there.

536
42:31.745 --> 42:34.585
Since my sister isn't here, I'll get going.

537
42:55.105 --> 42:56.265
Here's my contact info.

538
42:56.345 --> 42:58.985
If anything happens and you can't reach your sister, you can contact me.

539
42:59.065 --> 43:00.305
Are you that close to my sister?

540
43:02.105 --> 43:03.985
Otherwise, why would I be here?

541
43:04.065 --> 43:06.745
I won't contact you, so stop meddling in my business.

542
43:07.985 --> 43:10.545
Even if you're close to her, you and I aren't close.

543
43:25.545 --> 43:26.665
He's still young,

544
43:27.305 --> 43:28.585
but he's got quite a temper.

545
43:30.745 --> 43:34.105
CORE INTRODUCTION TO REHABILITATION THERAPY

546
43:42.345 --> 43:46.545
Maybe it was because I accepted that unfairly allocated spot

547
43:46.625 --> 43:49.185
that I later suffered all those consequences.

548
43:52.905 --> 43:56.465
DOCTOR TEAM XIE LIMING, ZHANG HUIMIN

549
44:00.865 --> 44:02.625
Why didn't you reply to my message?

550
44:02.705 --> 44:04.065
What are you looking at?

551
44:07.865 --> 44:08.745
What's wrong?

552
44:08.825 --> 44:10.465
As far as I remember,

553
44:10.545 --> 44:12.305
Zhuang Ning is from Hengjiang.

554
44:14.265 --> 44:15.705
Hengjiang High School.

555
44:15.785 --> 44:17.265
She and Xie Yudi are from the same place.

556
44:21.225 --> 44:23.465
Director Xie is from Shaoyang.

557
44:23.545 --> 44:25.665
How could his nephew be from Hengjiang?

558
44:26.265 --> 44:27.585
Those places are so far apart.

559
44:27.665 --> 44:30.145
Maybe the family moved.

560
44:30.225 --> 44:33.385
They may live in different places, but they're still blood relatives.

561
44:34.865 --> 44:38.065
People can move wherever they want, but their hometown doesn't change.

562
44:48.545 --> 44:49.665
Xiaozheng, you're here.

563
44:50.345 --> 44:54.425
Xiaochen, what was the ratio for that nutrient solution again?

564
44:55.385 --> 44:56.865
I'll help you mix it at the water station.

565
44:56.945 --> 44:57.905
All right.

566
45:03.545 --> 45:05.105
Zheng Yu, perfect timing.

567
45:05.185 --> 45:07.665
This is this year's Compassionate Care Bed application form.

568
45:07.745 --> 45:09.225
You were so eager before.

569
45:09.305 --> 45:11.745
Now that applications are open, why haven't you said anything?

570
45:12.985 --> 45:15.585
My eligibility to apply hasn't been revoked?

571
45:15.665 --> 45:18.225
What do you mean? Why would we revoke it for no reason?

572
45:21.305 --> 45:22.545
I have a question.

573
45:23.425 --> 45:26.345
Does Director Xie have a nephew?

574
45:26.425 --> 45:27.305
Yes.

575
45:28.865 --> 45:32.025
He even attended his nephew's one-month celebration last month.

576
45:32.105 --> 45:34.425
I covered his shift that day. Why do you ask?

577
45:42.265 --> 45:45.385
I thought back then that the reason I got this bed was because…

578
45:48.505 --> 45:51.105
Isn't the spot for the program hard to get?

579
45:51.185 --> 45:53.545
Every department has a long waiting list.

580
45:53.625 --> 45:56.105
Why was I given one?

581
45:57.945 --> 46:00.985
When you applied back then, you'd just turned eighteen.

582
46:01.065 --> 46:02.345
Eighteen!

583
46:02.425 --> 46:05.465
Compared to the rest of us, you were practically still a child.

584
46:05.545 --> 46:07.305
There were no other adults at home,

585
46:07.385 --> 46:09.385
and you had an underage brother to care for.

586
46:09.465 --> 46:10.945
Considering all that,

587
46:11.025 --> 46:17.025
both our hospital and society as a whole should and must give you priority.

588
46:20.545 --> 46:23.465
Remember to fill out the forms. Don't forget.

589
46:37.385 --> 46:42.145
COMPASSIONATE CARE BED PROGRAM APPLICATION INSTRUCTIONS

590
47:17.785 --> 47:19.345
Ms. Yang said you might be here.

591
47:20.225 --> 47:21.345
Sure enough, you are.

592
47:23.625 --> 47:26.305
I can't believe the hospital rooftop isn't even locked.

593
47:27.425 --> 47:29.185
It's supposed to be locked.

594
47:29.265 --> 47:30.265
As well as the rooftop,

595
47:30.865 --> 47:33.945
the windows on the upper floors are also restricted from opening too far.

596
47:34.025 --> 47:37.705
They're even secured with rivets to prevent people from jumping.

597
47:37.785 --> 47:39.505
The hospital would be liable otherwise.

598
47:41.425 --> 47:43.985
Then how did you find out that the rooftop wasn't locked?

599
47:45.465 --> 47:47.065
I stumbled across it by chance.

600
47:47.625 --> 47:49.945
The lock was really old and had broken.

601
47:50.905 --> 47:54.185
After that, Ms. Yang and I would sneak up here to hang laundry.

602
47:55.305 --> 47:56.825
She loves watching the sunset.

603
47:56.905 --> 47:59.305
She often takes photos to share with her online followers.

604
48:05.545 --> 48:07.345
If only I'd met you all sooner.

605
48:10.185 --> 48:11.425
That way,

606
48:13.225 --> 48:14.745
I could've been part of your group.

607
48:19.865 --> 48:22.785
If you hadn't taken leave and transferred into our class,

608
48:22.865 --> 48:24.265
we probably wouldn't have met.

609
48:25.785 --> 48:28.065
I'd have been busy taking care of Mom every day,

610
48:28.145 --> 48:30.865
and you'd have been busy with your paper.

611
48:31.745 --> 48:35.545
Maybe this is what they mean by a blessing in disguise.

612
48:36.865 --> 48:40.105
How do you know it's a blessing?

613
48:43.705 --> 48:44.905
I believe it is.

614
49:23.305 --> 49:29.225
THREE YEARS AGO

615
50:55.785 --> 50:57.665
JIANG MIAN

616
51:10.185 --> 51:11.025
Zheng Yu.

617
51:11.825 --> 51:13.185
Why are your eyes so red?

618
51:14.265 --> 51:16.465
I got dust in my eyes in the stairwell.

619
51:17.785 --> 51:19.385
By the way, how's Mom doing?

620
51:20.185 --> 51:23.425
The doctor said her condition is stable for now, so don't worry.

621
54:08.825 --> 54:13.825
